Disabled Features
=================

Some rclone features are disabled in the Debian build,
since the go modules they depend on are not yet available in Debian.

Disabled backends:
- archive (squashfs): requires diskfs
- azureblob and azurefiles
- cloudinary
- filescom
- internxt (requires internxt/rclone-adapter)
- oracleobjectstorage
- qingstor
- storj

Disabled commands:
- nfsmount (serve nfs)
- serve ftp
- serve s3

Other disabled features:
- gomobile
